{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every camera located on the bottom side of the scene, there is a cutting board arranged above it. Above the cutting board are headphones, followed by a tie above the headphones, and a fork above the tie. Additionally, the fork is smaller than the cutting board.",
